+# Invoice preview flag repair
+
+The flag now returns legacy when disabled. Rollback flips `enabled` to false in `config/invoice-preview.json`.
+
+Preview is still loaded so operators can confirm the invoice totals after a kill switch.
diff --git a/08 Evidence-led PRs/exercise-02-feature-flag-rollback-proof/feature-flag-app/scripts/rollback-invoice-preview.mjs b/08 Evidence-led PRs/exercise-02-feature-flag-rollback-proof/feature-flag-app/scripts/rollback-invoice-preview.mjs
